My Valkyrie ascended. This is, I think, only my second pure ascension
(on someone else's public server, so no ability or temptation to restore
save files). From the start, the game was interesting. An abundance
of altars, and a very profitable set of bones levels (Gnomish minetown
yielded three sets of bones, and the big level yielded a fourth).

Most of the rest of the game went the usual sort of ways.
It took a couple tries at the Astral plane to find the right
spot, but the priests and priestesses were obliging with the
"insect-body-shields" until I could safely use conflict to
tie up the critters fighting with each other and dash through
them to the altar.

The "being killed once" was choking when eating too much. Almost
a YASD post, if it weren't for already having two AoLS.

